{"id": "86232", "name": "כפל שברים רציונליים – פירוק מכנה ריבועי וצמצום (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "igcd2", "params": ["p", "q"], "body": "if q=0 then abs(p) else igcd2(q,mod(p,q))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Express the following as a single fraction:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}\\cdot\\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p style=\"font-size:0.92em\">(Hint: Try factorising the fractions.)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Factorise the quadratic denominator, cancel the common bracket, then multiply.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Factorise</b><br>When multiplying fractions you can save work if the denominator of one fraction has common factors with the numerator of another. In this example, if we factorise the denominator of the first fraction (two numbers with product <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> and sum <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>) we obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:6}}\\cdot\\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Cancel and multiply</b><br>It is clear that the factor \\({{CT:7}}\\) is common in both fractions and so we can cancel \\({{CT:7}}\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:8}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{{CT:3}} = {{CT:9}}. \\]</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:11}}\"]]Multiplying, the numbers <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> have the common factor <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:10}}\\)</span>, which cancels as well.[[else]]Multiplying, the numbers <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> have no common factor, so nothing else cancels.[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "lowesttermsp(ans)", "tans": "true", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["G", "a", "c", "d1", "d2", "n1", "n2", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 50}